WEBVTT

00:01:28.276 --> 00:01:30.476
We can replace all our fossil fuel plants,

00:01:30.476 --> 00:01:32.996
have a clean version of today's world,

00:01:33.036 --> 00:01:34.916
walk away, we've solved climate change.

00:01:34.956 --> 00:01:36.516
Thank you very much.

00:01:36.516 --> 00:01:40.236
Oh, but I did forget
one tiny little detail.

00:01:41.156 --> 00:01:44.236
We actually need five times that much.

00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:47.396
To be clear, we need
and we're on track to have

00:01:47.436 --> 00:01:51.196
two and a half times
today's amount of clean generation

00:01:51.196 --> 00:01:54.596
to switch to a clean version
of our current electricity system.

00:01:54.956 --> 00:01:57.956
But changing the current
system isn't enough.

00:01:58.356 --> 00:02:00.996
We need five times that,